    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>lay as a  crab trying to keep a ball in the air. Move side to side, bop the ball up, and scoop up gold as they rain down upon you! The longer you keep the bounce going, the more treasure you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, meditative, replayable, and yet surprisingly difficult. Play alone or with a friend in Coop and competitive mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move left and right with the joystick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the ball bouncing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins for extra points</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a bounce? It\u2019s game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 Simple joystick controls: just move left or right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd0 Ball physics: keep it bouncing as long as you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Coin collection and score chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Easy to pick up and play</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf For Players Who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like casual reflex games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult games</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P</strong>lay as a  crab trying to keep a ball in the air. Move side to side, bop the ball up, and scoop up gold as they rain down upon you! The longer you keep the bounce going, the more treasure you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, meditative, replayable, and yet surprisingly difficult. Play alone or with a friend in Coop and competitive mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move left and right with the joystick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the ball bouncing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins for extra points</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss a bounce? It\u2019s game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 Simple joystick controls: just move left or right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd0 Ball physics: keep it bouncing as long as you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Coin collection and score chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Easy to pick up and play</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf For Players Who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like casual reflex games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult games</p></li></ul>",
